                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "Need to use \"library\" so we can add a version and get the .so.0 and .so.0.1 links by default. This then lets us work with obmc-phosphor-ipmiprovider-symlink.bbclass (which assumes the 2 links and the library during the install).\nThis was not fun figuring out."
